  "all_ingredients_flat": "red lentils, onion, grated carrot, purple cabbage, packed spinach, green chilli, fennel seeds, pepper powder, garlic powder, rolled oats, oat flour, spices",
  "instructions": "BATTER: Water sauté onions, carrot & cabbage in a pan for 5-7 mins until they soften. In a food processor, add the soaked & drained lentils, sautéed veggies, spinach & spices. Grind to a coarse texture. If we can't form patties with the batter, add a few teaspoons of rolled oats or oat flour to thicken the batter. Cool the batter in the fridge for 30 mins before baking. BAKING: Make patties — I baked at 350 for 30 mins.",
